@authorizationToken = f0b9c918aafc97ad149191a68a923a88057f78bcd56f5ae77ac98a26394a1851

### Crear un producto
POST http://localhost:3000/api/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authorizationToken}}

{
  "name": "Alimento para gato 15 kg",
  "category": "Alimentos",
  "price": 23000,
  "stock": 12,
  "minimumStock": 3
}

### Ver todos los productos
GET http://localhost:3000/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{authorizationToken}}

### Sumar 5 unidades al stock
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/products/6a85d5306fe258ad3dc76f22/stock
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authorizationToken}}

{
  "quantity": 5
}

### Restar 2 unidades del stock
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/products/6a85d5306fe258ad3dc76f22/stock
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authorizationToken}}

{
  "quantity": -2
}

### Ver productos con poco stock
GET http://localhost:3000/api/products/low-stock
Authorization: Bearer {{authorizationToken}}